# No em dash / en dash

Do **not** use em dashes (`—` U+2014) or en dashes (`–` U+2013) in:

- Dashboard UI strings (labels, titles, descriptions, toasts, placeholders)
- User-facing API error messages
- Comments that may be copied into UI

Use a normal hyphen (`-`), a comma, a period, or rephrase instead.

```text
Bad:  Copy them now — dismiss clears them.
Good: Copy them now. Dismiss clears them.
Good: Copy them now - dismiss clears them.
```

Existing docs/markdown timelines may keep dashes until touched; new UI copy must not introduce them.
